2. In these Rules, unless the context otherwise requires—

"member" means a member of the Commission and includes the Chairman and

Deputy Chairman of the Commission;

"meeting of the Commission" means a meeting of the Commission which is held in

accordance with rule 3;

"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Commission or any member who
discharges the functions of the Chairman in accordance with Clause (3A) of Article 142 of

the Federal Constitution;

"Secretary" means a Secretary of the Commission and includes the Deputy

Secretary of the Commission;

"Commission" means the Public Services Commission.

Meeting of the Commission

9. (1) The Secretary shall be the secretary to the meeting of the Commission.

(2) The Secretary shall be responsible to—

(a) _ issue notice of the meeting;

(b) ensure all papers to be tabled are ready before the meeting;

(c) ensure the meeting is conducted in accordance with these Rules;

